<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Aviation rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Aviation rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Helane Becker initiated coverage of First Aviation Services Inc with a buy rating, according to her office.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.90 per share for 1998, ending in January, and $1.07 for 1999.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $16. Shares rose 5/16 to 9.</p>
</text>
